---
import BaseLayout from '../components/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — 51NAV"
  description="How 51NAV handles your data. 51NAV is a static site and stores preferences locally in your browser."
>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <div class="guide-content mt-4">
      <p><em>Last updated: 2026-09-24</em></p>
      <h2>Overview</h2>
      <p>
        51NAV is a static website. We do not require accounts and we do not collect personal
        information to use the directory or search.
      </p>
      <h2>Local storage</h2>
      <p>
        Preferences such as your saved favorites and color-theme choice are stored
        <strong>only in your own browser</strong> via <code>localStorage</code>. This data never
        leaves your device and is not transmitted to our servers.
      </p>
      <h2>Analytics &amp; advertising</h2>
      <p>
        We may use privacy-friendly, aggregated analytics (such as Google Analytics 4) to understand
        overall traffic. When advertising is introduced (e.g. Google AdSense), those providers have
        their own policies, which we will link here.
      </p>
      <h2>External links</h2>
      <p>
        51NAV links to third-party websites. We are not responsible for the content or privacy
        practices of those sites; please review their policies independently.
      </p>
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>For privacy questions, please <a href="/contact">contact us</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
